      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>BinaryBuildSource describes a binary file to be used for the Docker and Source build strategies, where the file will be extracted and used as the build source.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><CodeBlock code={"`object`"} lang="plaintext" /></dd>
