      <h3 id="_specsourceimages" class="group scroll-mt-20">.spec.source.images<a href="#_specsourceimages" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>images describes a set of images to be used to provide source for the build</p></dd>
