      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>SecretBuildSource describes a secret and its destination directory that will be used only at the build time. The content of the secret referenced here will be copied into the destination directory instead of mounting.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><CodeBlock code={"`object`"} lang="plaintext" /></dd>
